            {
              "text": "\n        2 Bakam 18:1—20:21; 2 Byok 29:1—32:33.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunu nukwo okwolekwa kwa Isaaya mutabani w'Amozi, okurukukwata ha Yuda na Yerusaalemu, omu busumi obwa Huziya, Yosamu, Ahazi na Hezekiya, abakama ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohurre, iguru, iwe n'ensi otege okutu; habwokuba MUKAMA nuwe iwe agambire ati: “Abaana aba nayoroire kandi aba nakulize, nubo banyemiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enimi emanya mukama wayo, n'enkaina emanya mukama wayo nambere araara, Isirairi nyowe taamanyire, n'abantu bange tibarukunnyetegereza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haa, iwe ihanga erikora ebibi, inywe abantu abaijwire obubi, oruzaaro rw'enkozi z'ebibi, abaana abakora eby'obugobya! MUKAMA bakamufuruka, bakagaya Ogu Arukwera wa Isirairi, bakaahukanira kimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwaki mwikara nimwema? Nimwenda kufubirwa okukira nkooku mwafubiirwe? Isirairi, omutwe gwawe gwona, bihuta bisa omutima gwona niguruhirra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toina bwomeezi okuruga hamara g'okuguru, okuhika hamutwe, hoona binyubule bihooya, n'ebihuta ebirukujwa esagama; tibikwasirweho, tibisemberwe rundi kuteebwamu amagita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi yanyu, ekafooka kitongo, embuga zanyu bakazookya n'omurro; abanyamahanga bakahamba ensi yanyu nainywe muroleriire muti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuhara wa Siyoni asigaire nk'akasiisira omu rugonjo rw'emizabbibbu, nk'ekirindiro omu musiri gw'ebihweju, nirusisana nk'orubuga orugosirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 19:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar 9:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA ow'amahe kakuba ataratulekiireho abantu abake, twakubaire nka Sodomu, twakusisaine nka Gomora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe abalemi ba Sodomu muhurre MUKAMA ekyarukugamba. Inywe abantu ba Gomora, mutege amatu muhurre Ruhanga waitu eky'arukwegesa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.5.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amos 5:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.5.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naagamba ati: Ebyonzira byanyu ebingi ebi, nyowe mbiroho ki? Nkahongerwa ebihongwa bingi muno eby'empaya entaama n'eby'ebisoro eby'ebisajwa, tindukwenda sagama y'enimi, ey'ebyana by'entaama, rundi ey'empaya emburabuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu muba mwizire kukurata n'oha abaragira okurubatarubata omu bikaali byange? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutagaruka kundeetera ebihongwa byanyu ebitaina mugaso; tindukwenda bubbani, ebiro bikuru byanyu ebya buli kwezi, Sabbato zanyu, ensorookana zanyu, ebi byona bikasiiswa ebibi byanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameezi ganyu ag'emboneko, n'ebiro byanyu ebikuru ebyatairweho, tindukubyenda; bikafooka mugugu hali nyowe ogu ntasobora kwetweka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu muranyimukizaaga emikono mwina ebimurukunsaba, timbafeehoga; noobu mulinyesengereza muta, tindibaha eki murukusaba habwokuba mukaseesa esagama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwoge mwere; mwiheho obubi obw'engeso zanyu omumaiso gange; muleke okukora kubi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwege okukora ebirungi; mukole kyona eki murukusobora okugendera ha bwinganiza, mukoonyere abarukubonabonesibwa, murwanirre enfuuzi, mutonganirre abafaakati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naagamba ati: “Mwije nu, tuhanuule hamu; ebibi byanyu noobu biraaba bibahindwire, nimunanata ninyija okubogya, mwere nk'orubaale; ebibi byanyu noobu biraaba bibarofuhaize bita, mulyera tiititi nka pamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu muraaba nimworoba kandi nimukora ebimurukuragirwa mulirya ebirungi by'ensi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baitu obu muraayanga mukeema, mulihwerekerezibwa ekitara; habwokuba eki, MUKAMA nuwe akigambire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
